  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seconding a senior delegate to the Sierra Leone Electoral Reform Committee on behalf of the UN Resident Coordinator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will be funding a senior, experienced, and credible individual to work as both an advisor to the UN Resident Coordinator (UNRC), and act as an alternate co-chair of the Sierra Leone Electoral Reform Committee. We judge a credible external actor will be able to negotiate compromise, help the Committee navigate complicated constitutional and legal issues, and occasionally provide a decisive voice from the Chair, in a way that is not appropriate for the UNRC herself. This will increase the chances of a negotiated outcome and a successful and sustainable electoral reform process, which will strengthen a key pillar of Sierra Leone&#x2019;s democracy and protect political stability in an increasingly volatile context.</narrative>
  </description>
